VertexAV Director is not an official QLC+ release and is not endorsed by
the QLC+ project. "QLC+" and "Q Light Controller Plus" are used here only
to name the software this product is derived from.

Changes made to QLC+ in this distribution:

- qmlui/director: the Director, which runs a show on its own following
  the music.
- qmlui/stagewizard: roles and the functions the Director works with.
- 3D view: a default rock stage.
- Fixture definitions added under resources/fixtures.
- Application name, settings location, Windows installer and file
  association identifiers, so that it installs next to QLC+.

Files taken from QLC+ keep their original copyright headers.
